        <title-group>
          <article-title lang="original"><![CDATA[사르트르의 실존주의에서 바라본 대한민국의 학생선수]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="foreign"><![CDATA[Student Athletes From the Perspective of Sartre's Existentialism]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="english"><![CDATA[Student Athletes From the Perspective of Sartre's Existentialism]]></article-title>
        </title-group>
